# AI Customer Complaint Management System

## Project Description
The AI Customer Complaint Management System is a backend application developed using FastAPI. It allows customers to submit complaints through a REST API. The system accepts complaint details, processes the request, and returns a successful response. It is designed as a foundation for an AI-powered complaint management system.

## Features
- Submit customer complaints
- FastAPI REST API
- Interactive Swagger API documentation
- Complaint categorization (Refund, Delivery, Payment, General)
- JSON request and response handling

## Technologies Used
- Python
- FastAPI
- Uvicorn
- Pydantic
- SQLAlchemy
- Transformers
- PyTorch

## Project Structure

```
backend/
│── main.py
│── README.md
│── requirements.txt
│── routers/
│     └── complaints.py
│── schemas/
│     └── complaint_schema.py
│── ai/
│     └── classifier.py
```

## Installation

Install the required packages:

```bash
pip install fastapi uvicorn sqlalchemy pydantic transformers torch
```

## Run the Project

```bash
uvicorn main:app --reload
```

## API Documentation

After running the server, open:

```
http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
```

## Sample Request

```json
{
  "customer_name": "Priyanka",
  "complaint": "My refund has not been processed."
}
```

## Sample Response

```json
{
  "customer": "Priyanka",
  "complaint": "My refund has not been processed.",
  "category": "Refund",
  "status": "Submitted Successfully"
}
```

